      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, there are already 5 vendor hooks for usb audio offload.\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_vendor_set  -\u003e used\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_connect      -\u003e used\nandroid_rvh_audio_usb_offload_disconnect -\u003e used\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_ep_action\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_synctype\n\nThe three vendor hooks were used because I also need that, but the last two are not the calling point that our vendor driver wants.\n\nSo I added the following vendor hooks.\n\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_set_rate :\nWe need to configure sampling rate supported by the interface of the connected audio device when pcm is prepared.\n\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_pcmbuf :\nWe need usb device information, interface number to configure a pcm buffer address when pcm is prepared.\n\nandroid_rvh_audio_usb_offload_pcm_intf :\nOur vendor driver need a dequeue pointer address configured after snd_usb_endpoint_configure is executed, and also need pcm intf num, alt setting num to map dequeue pointer.\n\nandroid_rvh_audio_usb_offload_pcm_control :\nour vendor driver need pcm status when pcm is open/close to do additional handling.\n\nandroid_vh_audio_usb_offload_pcm_binterval :\nour vendor driver need to choose audio data interval.\n\nThanks.",
      "parentUuid": "be54403c_ee0530f6",
